@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Security review gates
start
:Review production configuration and secret handling;
:Verify TLS, cookies and private database boundary;
:Verify least-privilege identity and storage permissions;
:Verify controlled Git binary and sanitized logging;
:Verify paired backups and recovery plan;
if (Required controls evidenced for candidate and host?) then (yes)
  :Record reviewer and evidence;
else (no)
  :Block deployment and resolve failed controls;
endif
stop
@enduml
